          "title": "Balloon Cup",
          "subtitle": "Vying",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Balloon Cup is a two-player commercial card game where players compete over balloon-flight trophy cards by playing resource cards to shared contest areas."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Designed by Stephen Glenn and published by Kosmos in 2003, Balloon Cup is a two-player contest game built around hand management, shared scoring areas, and racing to win three trophies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
