              "text": "Dedicated Balloon Cup deck with trophy and terrain/resource cards"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Balloon Cup deck with trophy and terrain/resource cards, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Set out trophy or terrain contest cards and deal a hand of resource cards to each player from the dedicated deck."
